<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merck, Warner-Lambert.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merck, Warner-Lambert.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded Merck &amp; Co Inc to buy from strong buy, but it upgraded Warner-Lambert Co to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
